%---------------- ISPF Tutorial 3 of 5: Filtering and Sorting ------------%
%Command ===>_ZCMD
+
 FILTER text performs a case-insensitive substring match on data set
 names. FILTER CLEAR restores the full catalog result set.
+
 SORT accepts NAME, VOL, SIZE, or DEVICE. Add A for ascending or D
 for descending order. For example:
+
   SORT VOL A
   SORT SIZE D
+
 FIND text searches names in the current filtered result set.
 RFIND repeats the most recent FIND and wraps at the end.
+
 Enter NEXT, PREV, 1-5, or END to navigate.
)END
